```mermaid
flowchart TB
  %% ========== USERS ==========
  U[Operator / DevOps / Governance] --> UI[ghostcontrol-ui (Next.js)]
  UI -->|HTTP| API[ghostcontrol-api (Control Plane API)]

  %% ========== CONTROL PLANE ==========
  API --> Q[(redis queue)]
  API --> AUD[(postgres audit db)]

  %% Planner & Policy
  Q --> PL[ghostcontrol-planner]
  PL --> POL[ghostcontrol-policy]
  PL -->|Signed Action Bundle| API

  %% ========== DATA PLANE ==========
  subgraph DataPlane[Data Plane: Signals]
    RPC[L1/L2/L3 RPC Probes] --> ING[ghostcontrol-ingest]
  end
  ING --> AUD
  ING --> Q

  %% ========== ACTION PLANE ==========
  API -->|dispatch action bundle| RUN[ghostcontrol-runner]
  RUN --> SOCKPROXY[docker-socket-proxy (restricted)]
  SOCKPROXY --> DOCKER[(Docker Engine)]
  RUN --> REPO[/Repo workspace mount/]
  RUN -->|evidence| AUD
  RUN -->|evidence| API

  %% ========== SAFETY ==========
  POL --> AUD
  RUN -->|post-verify| API
  API --> UI
```

